  "goal": "Dataset-wide ECG/PPG/ABP policy: keep native sample grid, source units and morphology; linearly bridge only short nonfinite gaps (<=80 ms) and otherwise flag them invalid; flag exactly-stuck (flat) runs instead of fabricating signal; remove isolated <=80 ms outlier spikes in PPG/ABP only; remove 50/60 Hz narrowband tones only when band fraction and neighbouring-spectrum contrast both indicate real line interference. Gross non-physiological ECG artefact that cannot be detected structurally or repaired is preserved as observed.",
